/ to test your subroutines, depending on which parts of the assignment
/ you attempt to complete.

/ Un-comment the next line if you have implemented the SubClearDisplay subroutine. (Task 3.1)
/JnS SubClearDisplay

/ Un-comment the next block to test your SubInputString subroutine. (Task 3.2)
/Load StringAddr
/Store InputStringAddr
/JnS SubInputString

/ Un-comment the next block to test your SubPaintChar subroutine. (Task 3.3)
/Load FontAddr
/Add SIXTYFOUR 
/Store PaintCharCharacter 
/Load Display22 
/Store PaintCharDisplay 
/JnS SubPaintChar 

/ Un-comment the next block to test your SubPaintString subroutine. (Task 3.4)
Load StringAddr
Store StringAddrForPainting
JnS SubPaintString/

/ This is the end of the main program.
Halt


